    "0cb5ed6d": {"text":"A penance, a surety, and a face-saving agreement empty the cathedral without blood.","hash":"h1-85325b03"},
    "0cbd4ae9": {"text":"Offer a witnessed settlement instead. ({money:10})","hash":"h1-d7dcda4a"},
    "0cc341a1": {"text":"At the evening majlis a braggart recites verses mocking your family — polished, cruel, and already being repeated with delight.","hash":"h1-d13e9180"},
