    "107025c1": {"text":"Think better of it.","hash":"h1-64ad6989"},
    "10703ebd": {"text":"You reach him — then something bursts against your helm. You wake in the surgeons’ tent, honored and broken.","hash":"h1-814b1873"},
    "10744211": {"text":"The siege works bite into {target}. Farms and streets behind your lines now answer to soldiers who ask whether they are conquerors, guests, or thieves.","hash":"h1-b34af742"},
    "107fdcb9": {"text":"💰 {province} is yours for {money:gold} — its old lord retires fat and forgotten. The court frowns on bought land.","hash":"h1-0cc7b6dd"},
    "10817e71": {"text":"Correct discipline and learn how the parishes truly work.","hash":"h1-373430bb"},
