    "133f53e1": {"text":"The bailiffs’ cart is full and the debt still stands. There is only one thing left to give: yourselves. The lord’s steward reads the sentence without pleasure — the family is bound to the land for the debt, to work it out in the lord’s own fields. The free days are over.","hash":"h1-8848eaa0"},
