    "1755a7bb": {"text":"Valencia","hash":"h1-732e43c2"},
    "17595561": {"text":"Workmen shoring the crypt uncover an ancient coffer: bones, a rusted ring, a scrap of cloth. The prior’s eyes gleam. Relics draw pilgrims — and pilgrims draw silver.","hash":"h1-95b82fca"},
    "175bcf45": {"text":"Immediate: {prestige} prestige, {voice} Common Voice, direct-vassal Standing {vassal}, and foreign-sovereign Standing {foreign}. These ranges include normal Standing bounds. The war itself grants no declaration or victory prestige and burdens the county with Conquered Without Right.","hash":"h1-f3864290"},
    "1765cf2b": {"text":"{money:amount} a season · shown in Money each season","hash":"h1-5602ea9c"},
    "17809141": {"text":"Best to kneel while there is still time.","hash":"h1-33068da9"},
    "1780c999": {"text":"Repair the incident without pretending it began a lawful war.","hash":"h1-1cfa4b35"},
    "17815a5f": {"text":"Tracks in the snow, big as your palm. Something has been at the sheep, and the dogs whine at dusk.","hash":"h1-5d5c9c98"},
    "178f52d5": {"text":"Patient","hash":"h1-7a4fd57a"},
    "178f64b1": {"text":"Reserved from the staffing assistant; manual choice remains available","hash":"h1-c287bb50"},
    "17933c41": {"text":"Hunt the spider yourself.","hash":"h1-7321d869"},
    "1798f4f5": {"text":"{rulername} of {rname} sends back your oath-knot in pieces: he will pay no more, kneel no more. His spears are sharpening.","hash":"h1-9df385db"},
    "17a965d7": {"text":"The old kingdoms stand divided while raiders, caliphs, and emperors contend.","hash":"h1-d939c948"},
    "17a9a349": {"text":"Abdicate and continue as {heir}","hash":"h1-e632a9cc"},
    "17b51915": {"text":"Nothing to spare.","hash":"h1-8f34b216"},
    "17c3a09b": {"text":"📜 You grant the local {profession} guild a {years}-year monopoly; its fee adds {money:fee} to the treasury.","hash":"h1-69cc09cc"},
    "17c6b861": {"text":"Requires {technology}.","hash":"h1-6cc0d9ef"},
    "17c9d07d": {"text":"Keep the county’s hands at home and accept a smaller host.","hash":"h1-d6816e5f"},
    "17cc6e79": {"text":"That policy cannot be brought before the Estates now.","hash":"h1-98a3ba4a"},
    "17d17615": {"text":"The Chamberlain’s Whisper","hash":"h1-11315548"},
    "17d27f99": {"text":"The herald of {enemy} does not gloat — greatness need not. His master’s offer is plain: kneel, swear the oaths, and this war dies here. Keep every acre, every tower, every man still breathing — held from a new lord. Or refuse, and lose them one by one.","hash":"h1-2e71c919"},
    "17d5c4bf": {"text":"Swear Fealty","hash":"h1-932b5c8c"},
    "17d76ed7": {"text":"Rest at the way-house. ({money:2})","hash":"h1-96dfa2d4"},
    "17dc9263": {"text":"Agriculture and animal power","hash":"h1-3aeadfc0"},
    "17dccbb1": {"text":"Resist","hash":"h1-b4b4529f"},
    "17e77f55": {"text":"Gain intrigue and public leverage, but drive the rivalry toward its dangerous end.","hash":"h1-8680a3b3"},
    "17fdf311": {"text":"+{amount} to every county’s development ceiling in the nation, above the base of 10","hash":"h1-823e7c86"},
    "1800e621": {"text":"Seek instruction in one of the great learned or urban centers.","hash":"h1-6320ae7b"},
    "181d4edd": {"text":"By dawn the sacks are hidden and the ledger is none the wiser. Winter holds no fear this year.","hash":"h1-cac29517"},
    "182018bb": {"text":"Choose a stake and developed market, then dispatch it or travel with it.","hash":"h1-4dcf02f0"},
    "18231673": {"text":"One careful hour against the dog’s memory.","hash":"h1-3ca537ae"},
    "18406445": {"text":"Answer an event","hash":"h1-41d9c76a"},
    "18510df1": {"text":"A firm no may cow him — or spur his riders.","hash":"h1-f456222d"},
    "18546841": {"forms":{"select":"value","param":"self","cases":{"yes":"🎓 You grow {trait}, like your tutor.","other":"🎓 {name} grows {trait}, like their tutor."}},"hash":"h1-c250c3a0"},
    "1856517b": {"text":"greatHolyWar has invalid lossGuaranteeYears.","hash":"h1-770ec21a"},
    "185ff165": {"text":"Rigid saddles stabilize mounted fighters and spread a rider’s weight.","hash":"h1-7ed05186"},
