    "1940b4b9": {"text":"Review a maximum-yield assignment across every unlocked enterprise. Applying it spends no day or money.","hash":"h1-9f008663"},
    "19455f35": {"text":"After the long road, {destination} stands before you. Dust, fatigue, and all the miles fall quiet at the sacred threshold.","hash":"h1-6e387b39"},
    "19465791": {"text":"War, claims, and conquest","hash":"h1-16d119f1"},
