    "1971e553": {"text":"▶ Resume","hash":"h1-bb9e5460"},
    "197665f1": {"text":"Soldiering","hash":"h1-0902bb43"},
    "197a5fed": {"text":"The ore caravans have not come — war or weather, nobody knows. Every smith and joiner in town is bidding for the same scraps.","hash":"h1-a15cfa9e"},
    "1991e7ff": {"text":"The Banners Meet","hash":"h1-307ecaea"},
    "19962639": {"text":"Path: hold the majority of two kingdoms of one empire to be crowned emperor.","hash":"h1-65d93735"},
    "1998edab": {"text":"Pay for clerks and enforcement; trade grows under rules everyone can read.","hash":"h1-e54e8fc4"},
    "199d2e09": {"text":"Coming of Age","hash":"h1-bce3d808"},
    "19a69031": {"text":"“Is that a DOG in the Gospel?” Scraping vellum for a month.","hash":"h1-4d1c6e4d"},
    "19aa9451": {"text":"Money, land plots, guild Standing, and local relationships open longer plans.","hash":"h1-b33b8b31"},
    "19b2fc5d": {"text":"mosque","hash":"h1-06bbe407"},
    "19b37835": {"text":"A missing leaf turns proof into insinuation. The charter’s defenders name you a liar.","hash":"h1-b5b31474"},
    "19b40775": {"text":"Bruised flesh","hash":"h1-d863c153"},
