    "1b670483": {"text":"Items from the family armory","hash":"h1-73509e40"},
    "1b7043a1": {"text":"Take what is owed, with dignity.","hash":"h1-868f6379"},
    "1b7f0271": {"text":"The miller arrives with his tally. Broken wheel or not, he says the lord is owed his customary share.","hash":"h1-83be64fd"},
    "1b89d2e7": {"text":"Dyrrachion","hash":"h1-6031d7b4"},
    "1b8b5b23": {"text":"The last argument of a lord — and the first thing raiders see. (+60 levy, +20 men-at-arms)","hash":"h1-9a2b5ada"},
    "1b8e1139": {"text":"Strength returns to your limbs at last. The sickness has run its course.","hash":"h1-55e91a6d"},
    "1b94cfa5": {"text":"Surrender the lands for your lives and your strongboxes.","hash":"h1-fa9cf54f"},
    "1ba009a9": {"text":"Survey Rolls and Seal Press","hash":"h1-f09b5948"},
    "1ba03295": {"text":"Tighten belts and endure.","hash":"h1-2209f826"},
    "1ba9caf1": {"text":"Serve flawlessly.","hash":"h1-8b993c42"},
    "1bae8b01": {"text":"The new head receives the family’s money in full (no death dues), land, realm, house property, enterprises, and the family armory.","hash":"h1-f96ecdb9"},
    "1bb06bf5": {"text":"A name in the right ledger opens doors.","hash":"h1-7b71c876"},
    "1bb0c98d": {"text":"Synagogue or charity school","hash":"h1-3ca9e386"},
