    "1be8783d": {"text":"Ocean-Going Knarrs","hash":"h1-c9b587bb"},
    "1bec7d5b": {"text":"Unavailable during an unresolved event","hash":"h1-9c049188"},
    "1bf2216f": {"text":"Wander the pleasure quarter.","hash":"h1-e1eb675c"},
    "1c0422b1": {"text":"Trade crosses where the ford once drowned it.","hash":"h1-66603f1d"},
    "1c138acf": {"text":"What the tree gives freely costs you little.","hash":"h1-464b6270"},
    "1c16de8f": {"text":"{cost} research · about {seasons} season","hash":"h1-0c1418cd"},
    "1c257571": {"text":"Graving Docks","hash":"h1-a52a985d"},
    "1c25da5d": {"text":"Holder","hash":"h1-1fd1bbc3"},
    "1c2cbcc9": {"text":"A chill takes hold after leaving {location}. By nightfall, the road sways even when you stand still.","hash":"h1-3a1014f0"},
    "1c476759": {"text":"Available now: {action}","hash":"h1-cd20c8ea"},
    "1c47b181": {"text":"⛓ The faithful condemn your attack upon {realm}. Your piety is forfeit, and you are excommunicated.","hash":"h1-f4f8ebde"},
    "1c5cac21": {"text":"Press {childname}’s claim.","hash":"h1-f7833cd0"},
    "1c5fa7b1": {"text":"+1 piety a season while he serves","hash":"h1-1748c364"},
    "1c60fb27": {"text":"Incomplete binding","hash":"h1-0b646810"},
    "1c6913af": {"text":"🏠 The household establishes {level} for {standard}.","hash":"h1-ce9598c5"},
    "1c70ae95": {"text":"Battle — the Field Is Yours","hash":"h1-6d1ab224"},
    "1c7496d1": {"text":"Hold a consistory","hash":"h1-db27cc7c"},
    "1c78c4b5": {"text":"Lock this worker to this enterprise","hash":"h1-99e53946"},
    "1c7cd8c1": {"text":"Quarter Steering Oars","hash":"h1-e8804909"},
    "1c7f3991": {"text":"The cathedral canons answer your latest order with old privileges, older seals, and the serene confidence of men who expect to outlast you.","hash":"h1-acde4933"},
    "1c7f8fd9": {"text":"Wasit","hash":"h1-7ce4dd3f"},
    "1c82371d": {"text":"No event ever interrupts the days — even mortal danger and the naming of an heir resolve on their own. Only your death and the choice of a successor stop the flow.","hash":"h1-b6dd6ad6"},
    "1c86b52b": {"text":"The Pact’s Wax Cools","hash":"h1-3dcc3032"},
    "1c9350b1": {"text":"Crown Authority","hash":"h1-936b7da1"},
    "1c9d84fd": {"text":"Clear","hash":"h1-dbd7d812"},
    "1ca751d9": {"text":"Mercantile","hash":"h1-8493fc57"},
    "1cb0f585": {"text":"After a year of local life, permanent settlement may become available. Each character can relocate the household only once in their lifetime.","hash":"h1-f11474d7"},
    "1cb9a149": {"text":"their house would provide exactly {money:gold}","hash":"h1-f7085671"},
    "1cc97e71": {"text":"Other enterprises","hash":"h1-b66cda31"},
    "1ccfea81": {"text":"Cardinal Deacon","hash":"h1-c0fd9c59"},
    "1cd2c6f9": {"text":"Everything is in place: the draught measured, the stair loosened, the witnesses elsewhere. {spouse} suspects nothing. One nod from you and it is done.","hash":"h1-c29dcab6"},
    "1cd3cf15": {"text":"A wandering master mason, church-trained and road-worn, offers to oversee your works before moving on to richer courts.","hash":"h1-5e1442d4"},
    "1cd6a8cd": {"text":"Remove all mods","hash":"h1-bc46137f"},
    "1cd9f1bb": {"text":"Nasal Helm","hash":"h1-de7e260c"},
    "1ce4bdb3": {"text":"not enough money","hash":"h1-856e2172"},
