    "1cea7e31": {"text":"Patronize a promising rider. ({money:20})","hash":"h1-721e43b9"},
    "1ced9939": {"text":"Direct national research.","hash":"h1-1d765367"},
    "1cf32a27": {"text":"Contest the Caliphate?","hash":"h1-c72e6ae6"},
    "1d00c301": {"text":"A neutral household offers safe conduct, an exchange of captives, and an end without triumph. The road home is open now; another defeat may close it.","hash":"h1-f1298e49"},
    "1d0a9bcb": {"text":"Meißen","hash":"h1-47cf84e4"},
    "1d0bbbb7": {"text":"Path: petition your liege for a county — or declare independence and take one.","hash":"h1-fcdfc5c2"},
    "1d152079": {"text":"Dowry","hash":"h1-743ef4a4"},
    "1d180759": {"text":"Discipline","hash":"h1-9948db9f"},
    "1d1a399d": {"text":"A diadem of an empire nobody remembers — and everybody bows to.","hash":"h1-ba2ac71f"},
    "1d209afd": {"text":"Daughter of the chief’s house","hash":"h1-0727e31c"},
    "1d220237": {"text":"Good words, freely given, freely kept.","hash":"h1-b268870a"},
    "1d37599f": {"text":"Galway","hash":"h1-2691018e"},
    "1d48208d": {"text":"It is done openly now: {rival} publishes a claim to everything you hold — a worm-eaten genealogy, a bought witness, and promises to every malcontent in the county, with foreign coin behind all of it. Men begin choosing which side to kneel to.","hash":"h1-db9a5bcd"},
    "1d4ff961": {"text":"{season} {day}, {year}","hash":"h1-1f3a497b"},
    "1d50b9f3": {"text":"Religious standing: {rank}","hash":"h1-fadc1c46"},
    "1d51baa1": {"text":"75 seasoned cavalry join the current host, adding about {money:1.5} to seasonal logistics.","hash":"h1-6e15e87d"},
    "1d63f535": {"text":"fast","hash":"h1-45ce1f4b"},
    "1d6d76e5": {"text":"At the destination you must remain in guest residence for at least {days} days before returning home.","hash":"h1-43c7aa02"},
