    "1d821761": {"text":"Steward’s Account Chest","hash":"h1-cccbaeb9"},
    "1d85f779": {"text":"⛓ The debt is worked off in the lord’s own fields, season upon season.","hash":"h1-eece1acd"},
    "1d9c0d01": {"text":"By dawn the fever breaks and you are still at your post.","hash":"h1-43202c5b"},
    "1da14823": {"text":"Rostov","hash":"h1-859da044"},
    "1da5b1c1": {"text":"Force a decision in the field — only while they have no host raised. A fielded enemy must be hunted on the map.","hash":"h1-c92eb189"},
