    "2bbedec5": {"text":"Choose a stake and developed market, then dispatch the venture or accompany it.","hash":"h1-fb3df7b6"},
    "2bc241d1": {"text":"👑 {name}: you hold {held} — {need} and independence make the king.","hash":"h1-d784be4a"},
    "2bc45961": {"text":"Review the camps, target, and time remaining before the banners march.","hash":"h1-78b12311"},
    "2bc4b9b7": {"text":"Scouts need volunteers to cross dangerous ground before dawn. Success would bring useful intelligence; failure may leave no road home.","hash":"h1-0380c93c"},
