    "2ce4bdab": {"text":"A small holy sign worn close to the heart.","hash":"h1-51006b6a"},
    "2ce90a4b": {"text":"Too young for an apprenticeship yet.","hash":"h1-53e7a58a"},
    "2cee8e09": {"text":"👤 {heir} takes up the family’s story while {former} retires to {destination}. Generation {generation}.","hash":"h1-60cf4ed1"},
    "2cf0fcc1": {"text":"The lord’s steward finds you among the ashes and is almost kind: “This will keep happening while the wars last. My lord’s wall is high and his men are many. Bring your household inside it, and no host will touch what is his. All he asks is what every protected man owes: service.” Freedom or safety — the old bargain.","hash":"h1-c6b7ba3b"},
    "2cf1e581": {"text":"Fair of face.","hash":"h1-cc288d6d"},
    "2cf83651": {"text":"Put ink, masters, and books behind the see’s authority.","hash":"h1-3b3e5f41"},
    "2cfaa1bb": {"text":"Playing a woman in {year} is a harder road: some doors open only by marriage, others only by defiance.","hash":"h1-9bbfdd99"},
    "2cfe0bad": {"text":"Circumstances changed before the visit could begin.","hash":"h1-85a0d36a"},
    "2cff565f": {"text":"A thin, sad yield. Winter will have teeth this year.","hash":"h1-7c9a4d9c"},
