    "2d5c2e21": {"text":"Enter","hash":"h1-94cd2f25"},
    "2d5d1c25": {"text":"Pray for them from a safe distance.","hash":"h1-2d416733"},
    "2d5eeda1": {"text":"Pilgrims, penitents, and younger sons come straggling beneath the sacred banners. They have brought their own spears and little else, asking only for a place in the line.","hash":"h1-e848552b"},
    "2d5f27e3": {"text":"Alternating crop and fallow protects exhausted soil.","hash":"h1-7180da50"},
    "2d61923d": {"text":"Free Farmer","hash":"h1-749a3d92"},
    "2d622b83": {"text":"Pay two seasons of current live-host logistics. Supply raises abstract condition; live troops do not change.","hash":"h1-d3311906"},
    "2d6af081": {"text":"🗡 Evidence publicly blackens {rival}’s political name.","hash":"h1-d64fa49b"},
    "2d6fb701": {"text":"Listen before speaking.","hash":"h1-584ee399"},
    "2d76ab85": {"text":"Plots pass to your heirs and earn produce each season. Each additional plot in the same settlement makes the whole holding {bonus}% more productive; gather {needed} together to declare a manor.","hash":"h1-dcb0ed7c"},
    "2d7dcb15": {"text":"Wartime only. If carried, the estates formally back the liege’s war, and your name is attached to the authorization.","hash":"h1-fd790b23"},
    "2d88cff5": {"text":"Become known as someone who arrives with the right words.","hash":"h1-414dd903"},
    "2d8a4579": {"text":"The piece bears your name, and buyers begin asking after it.","hash":"h1-b8d7cddb"},
    "2d984ea1": {"text":"Disposition","hash":"h1-63430110"},
    "2da0a7ad": {"text":"Reverse course and repair the foreign relationship.","hash":"h1-1c091f37"},
