    "2f57cf81": {"text":"Charm a honey-cake from the baker.","hash":"h1-7cf499cb"},
    "2f5fe4dd": {"text":"Practical help makes the visit part of ordinary life.","hash":"h1-ca743740"},
    "2f6bd50f": {"text":"Outside assent","hash":"h1-a15f440a"},
    "2f78ec4d": {"text":"Locked enterprises and deeds link back to their prerequisite technology.","hash":"h1-6a98147b"},
    "2f7a7a35": {"text":"📜 The local {profession} guild’s monopoly expires; its toll privilege returns to the ordinary law.","hash":"h1-65a03166"},
    "2f7c4381": {"text":"The old wound has opened beneath sweat and mail. The surgeon says one quiet week may close it; the captain says the line is already short.","hash":"h1-176b6289"},
    "2f7e1ca9": {"text":"A weak constitution.","hash":"h1-08f6911b"},
    "2f81cd85": {"text":"The lord smiles, promises nothing, and speaks of the weather.","hash":"h1-b93a6aeb"},
    "2f84f241": {"text":"Grim work, holy work. The village will not forget.","hash":"h1-7c34ad69"},
    "2f852941": {"text":"No buildings stand in {settlement} yet.","hash":"h1-cfc6448c"},
    "2f8f31b9": {"text":"🏛 {ruler} of {realm} is raised to your council.","hash":"h1-9578a724"},
    "2f90e715": {"text":"Foreign sovereign","hash":"h1-b901a91b"},
    "2f97adb9": {"text":"The harvest failed across {province}, and now the roads fill with hollow-eyed families drifting toward your keep.","hash":"h1-c435a4a2"},
    "2f9addcd": {"text":"Land is taken only by siege:","hash":"h1-c124667b"},
    "2f9c3871": {"text":"Capacity comes from reliable income, eligible collateral, and a capped allowance for standing, less current obligations. Windfalls and new loans do not count.","hash":"h1-ad26dc11"},
    "2f9ddc4d": {"text":"A Victory for the Faith","hash":"h1-a9a4d39a"},
    "2fac2971": {"text":"Astonishingly, the lie holds.","hash":"h1-809d2eaa"},
