    "39131ac1": {"text":"It carries — first by voices, then by a show of hands the steward cannot ignore. The aid falls, and the liege’s courtesy promises nothing good.","hash":"h1-a7877d73"},
    "3913758d": {"text":"Choose equipment from the shared family armory.","hash":"h1-f8acd520"},
    "3919f78f": {"text":"A landowner needs thirty pieces before harvest and will pledge his mill as surety. Usury is frowned upon — profit rarely is.","hash":"h1-fb050238"},
