    "3c4df71b": {"text":"Fire takes a neighbor’s roof in a hard wind. You and {rival} arrive from opposite lanes, each with people and ladders, and find yourselves holding the same sagging beam while sparks fall around you.","hash":"h1-645c7cfa"},
