    "3ca8fb59": {"text":"Fresh mounts and prepared stations carry official news rapidly.","hash":"h1-fb17618c"},
    "3cb69325": {"text":"At the Noble Academy, {student} catches the notice of a patron whose table gathers ambitious heirs and useful names. An introduction could open a door, but patrons admire silver almost as much as promise.","hash":"h1-69f947c8"},
