    "4399a6e1": {"text":"🕊 Send an envoy…","hash":"h1-0b463702"},
    "43a1a5c7": {"text":"The shears bite; your braid coils on the barn floor and you are someone else. Chest bound flat under a dead brother’s shirt, voice pitched low, a man’s name ready on your tongue, you fall in at the tail of the column. Ahead in the ranks — close enough to see, too close to be safe — marches {suitor}, who does not know you from any other raw recruit.","hash":"h1-6e6ae9ae"},
