    "577f1c3b": {"text":"A Page in the Hall","hash":"h1-ca742b6c"},
    "5784a13d": {"text":"{bloc} starting posture","hash":"h1-31415727"},
    "578df321": {"text":"Reduce the existing aid one step without bypassing the estates permanently; lose coin, prestige, and Standing.","hash":"h1-ea068c01"},
    "579cf0eb": {"text":"Review every currently eligible descendant before saving these limits.","hash":"h1-7238820a"},
    "57a4fec1": {"text":"Work hard and be noticed.","hash":"h1-8375d26d"},
    "57a66ce1": {"text":"🎁 You offer {money:gold} to {ruler} of {realm}. (Standing {favor})","hash":"h1-7be95b9c"},
    "57abee81": {"text":"A thread snaps — a bought man sells you back. Every neighbor knows whose hand held the knife.","hash":"h1-6ff81fd9"},
    "57b828a9": {"text":"Your incoming {profession} monopoly is tied to {province} and will end immediately when the household leaves.","hash":"h1-f135b742"},
    "57bb1079": {"text":"Press the appeal.","hash":"h1-fb61aa00"},
    "57c38901": {"text":"Remit the disputed amount.","hash":"h1-0b3c3651"},
    "57cfe00b": {"text":"Accept the Pope’s absolution","hash":"h1-ebcd65a8"},
    "57d271b1": {"text":"Asturias","hash":"h1-cb604907"},
    "57d2b019": {"text":"{icon} {name}","hash":"h1-c2fbcd89"},
    "57d538bb": {"text":"Patient inquiry uncovers an old and credible chain of custody.","hash":"h1-2dffc0f2"},
    "57e3a14d": {"text":"☰ → Settings sets the speed of days.","hash":"h1-669d4b4b"},
    "57f5ae21": {"text":"Caucasian","hash":"h1-70a8975b"},
    "57f8800d": {"text":"Independence","hash":"h1-e25667ab"},
    "57f97811": {"text":"🎁 Your courier delivers {item} to {recipient} of {realm}. (Standing {value})","hash":"h1-2880bc35"},
    "57fa58a1": {"text":"Cluj","hash":"h1-0a106b19"},
    "580a5a6d": {"text":"Supplies raise abstract condition; promises burden your reputation.","hash":"h1-35d14b50"},
    "5811bb61": {"text":"Your home county is under an extraordinary muster; relief cannot be moved now.","hash":"h1-42fa8fdb"},
    "58122b63": {"text":"Direct vassal of {realm}","hash":"h1-5751d791"},
    "58187743": {"text":"Declare a War of Aggression?","hash":"h1-83882438"},
    "581e4fd1": {"text":"Equipment assignments changed after this review. A fresh plan is shown; review it before applying.","hash":"h1-b08d677d"},
    "581ec317": {"text":"The fighting is done and the carrion birds have come down to their work. Battered or triumphant, you find {suitor} among the living — and when you drag the helm off your cropped head and speak in your own true voice at last, he goes white, then red, then utterly and gratifyingly speechless. A year of blisters and terror and midnight fear, all for this face gaping at you like a fish just landed. Let the poets make of it what they will; they have sung of stranger women under armor.","hash":"h1-735be28e"},
    "583038f5": {"text":"with no fixed end","hash":"h1-132eae07"},
    "583a284d": {"text":"Northampton","hash":"h1-b95c30bf"},
    "583e52c1": {"text":"The binding holds through the march. The veterans begin to use your name.","hash":"h1-f32c40fa"},
    "584a051d": {"text":"Frees the one personal-attention assignment.","hash":"h1-8619a4eb"},
    "5852fde1": {"text":"Won the joust at a tourney.","hash":"h1-d246c76f"},
    "585511bd": {"text":"Sponsor the rival","hash":"h1-afa1616a"},
    "58656169": {"text":"Tahert","hash":"h1-dede98a3"},
    "586dc205": {"text":"Voted: {name}","hash":"h1-70f9b589"},
    "58769bc9": {"text":"Gunpowder Knowledge","hash":"h1-49738eb4"},
    "587b4707": {"text":"You make him laugh, and the toll is forgotten.","hash":"h1-22d9679a"},
    "587ff135": {"text":"Volga Bulgaria","hash":"h1-a7640fd3"},
    "588288ef": {"text":"⚠ This life’s records have outgrown the browser’s save storage — 📤 Export (Menu → 💾 Save game) still keeps the life as text.","hash":"h1-8440c5bc"},
    "5883f025": {"text":"Choose up to two qualified bishops. One family appointment per pontificate is tolerated; later relatives cost authority and Curial opinion.","hash":"h1-f6c3cbc3"},
    "588f3f21": {"text":"Closed a cautious venture in {destination}.","hash":"h1-ec134fcb"},
    "588fa579": {"text":"At least one match is blocked by marriage doctrine.","hash":"h1-de035817"},
    "589276b9": {"text":"The Ford in Flood","hash":"h1-94b9d0f4"},
    "5892e419": {"text":"Continue clerical service and meet the current faith’s office requirements.","hash":"h1-7a3ac32e"},
    "58a47e21": {"text":"Your house name follows every member of your dynasty. Personal names and patronymics are unchanged.","hash":"h1-a1bbcd9d"},
    "58a835bb": {"text":"Barns and talk. Let them meet.","hash":"h1-e9ff857e"},
    "58b3a6ad": {"text":"A Vassal’s Suit","hash":"h1-74247d57"},
    "58bf8b99": {"text":"A living lawful heir is required to continue the story.","hash":"h1-4a5a3b6d"},
    "58c7707d": {"text":"Remain on the visit for {days} more days before returning home.","hash":"h1-059407a5"},
    "58c93d19": {"text":"The lord’s men arrive while your arms are full.","hash":"h1-88c42da2"},
    "58cd41fd": {"text":"the lord","hash":"h1-d3a3d5c7"},
    "58cf2bb1": {"text":"{amount}% unrest harm","hash":"h1-48cb8789"},
