    "5c3e8a1b": {"text":"🚩 Muster the host","hash":"h1-0b9a3926"},
    "5c44e30b": {"text":"Personal attention improves one chosen relationship a little each day.","hash":"h1-3c3f90be"},
    "5c469df1": {"text":"🧰 {name} takes up work in {career}.","hash":"h1-db7e61a8"},
    "5c4b15d5": {"text":"★★★★ hard","hash":"h1-01353b22"},
    "5c547909": {"text":"Requires development {development}.","hash":"h1-97a74704"},
    "5c5582a9": {"text":"The supply wagons are late again, and the host eats the countryside as it goes. A farmstead ahead has full cribs and frightened eyes.","hash":"h1-561ba1b0"},
    "5c61140d": {"text":"This person is already your named friend.","hash":"h1-462f02ea"},
    "5c69c3e1": {"text":"Raises monastic output by 15%.","hash":"h1-617b2aa1"},
    "5c732329": {"text":"Usrushana","hash":"h1-7efc7247"},
    "5c753d89": {"text":"You need at least {money:needed} (now {money:current}).","hash":"h1-66f93d45"},
    "5c7aa431": {"text":"{god} preserve us.","hash":"h1-b2c6bdcb"},
    "5c7f7b4b": {"text":"Endowed institutions gather wards, practitioners, medicines, and teaching.","hash":"h1-34b6b630"},
    "5c84f2bf": {"text":"Tax the immunity and close the argument.","hash":"h1-53eabfd8"},
    "5c8e4dc3": {"text":"House or dynasty: characters sharing the house identity. Same-house membership matters for wider succession, but does not by itself make someone controllable or resident.","hash":"h1-53463bf0"},
    "5c95f999": {"text":"⚖ {new_liege} takes you as his direct man — {old_liege} is passed over.","hash":"h1-20167edf"},
    "5c9d8155": {"text":"Raises estate-service output by 5%.","hash":"h1-29fb0470"},
    "5cbd85c9": {"text":"🤝 Personal attention 0/{capacity} · no assignment · +{rate} Standing/day when assigned","hash":"h1-d7f0eeed"},
