    "64d793af": {"text":"Requires all","hash":"h1-707c9b4a"},
    "64def69b": {"text":"📜 Changelog","hash":"h1-1e0fa55e"},
    "64e01e27": {"text":"A debt forgotten is a friend kept.","hash":"h1-fd09e754"},
    "64e3af7b": {"text":"Living children lead; without them the succession walks outward through same-house branches.","hash":"h1-24a64a42"},
    "64ec0dc7": {"text":"War Comes to You","hash":"h1-6756adb2"},
    "64f458db": {"text":"Learning joins literacy, law, medicine, doctrine, and accumulated knowledge.","hash":"h1-1c0ed620"},
    "64f66745": {"text":"Concentric Defenses","hash":"h1-922a09ae"},
    "64f83301": {"text":"🕊 The envoy returns, gifts refused. {realm} is unmoved.","hash":"h1-cede56fa"},
    "65132b01": {"text":"Denmark","hash":"h1-4bce1879"},
    "6528c179": {"text":"Current level","hash":"h1-ddef2450"},
    "652a398d": {"text":"Days blur into blisters and bruises. The serjeant’s stick finds every dropped shield, and the men wash and boast and sprawl with no thought for the slight recruit who always slips off alone. Your arms harden; the spear stops feeling like a stranger in your hands. And once, across the cook-fire, {suitor} passes you the bread without a second glance — and your treacherous heart nearly betrays you where the serjeant’s eye never could.","hash":"h1-9ae6a172"},
    "6533b3f1": {"text":"{count}/{needed} plots — ready to declare a manor once the household has enough standing","hash":"h1-5ffeb479"},
    "65533051": {"text":"You need at least {needed} Standing with your lord (now {current}).","hash":"h1-6622ca43"},
    "655ee82f": {"text":"Keep your edge regardless.","hash":"h1-259be208"},
    "6560b1b1": {"text":"Carried an emergency war subsidy in the estates.","hash":"h1-dc8281a7"},
    "65610531": {"text":"A clear account may carry the day.","hash":"h1-d7d59351"},
    "6567b0b5": {"text":"That character cannot receive a visit.","hash":"h1-5c384107"},
    "657125e9": {"text":"Kabul","hash":"h1-a15415d0"},
    "6571b707": {"text":"No coin risked; knowledge travels both ways.","hash":"h1-32c15a2a"},
    "657a5dd1": {"text":"The hands stay down. Your motion dies in a long silence, and the liege’s smile finds you across the hall.","hash":"h1-e70ba2c4"},
    "65900225": {"text":"Everything you hold rides on one field.","hash":"h1-1e68c5ea"},
    "6599acad": {"text":"Fell in battle against {enemy}.","hash":"h1-7c625ec8"},
    "659bcca1": {"text":"Last annual movement","hash":"h1-04aea659"},
    "659f6421": {"text":"An iron cap and a long guard over the nose.","hash":"h1-fb06dd71"},
    "65a2da95": {"text":"No currently eligible child has an empty choice affected by this policy. The policy will still apply when another child becomes eligible.","hash":"h1-b8e541f4"},
    "65a8ec0d": {"text":"Seek the next religious rank — {rank}","hash":"h1-0c9f19b2"},
    "65b19051": {"text":"The Estates…","hash":"h1-599cab11"},
    "65b78fc9": {"text":"I will do the family proud.","hash":"h1-fd0c792a"},
    "65ba6d4f": {"text":"Share the day’s burdens.","hash":"h1-9a021e52"},
    "65c06da1": {"text":"Filter list","hash":"h1-3ecadaad"},
    "65c36a3d": {"text":"A local cadet","hash":"h1-ebbc23da"},
    "65c90365": {"text":"🏅 {name} is raised as guildmaster.","hash":"h1-05c1dd3f"},
    "65ca1413": {"text":"Your motion is a quiet one: that the old customs of your home county — the gleaning rights, the mill tolls, the parish feasts — be written and confirmed, so no steward’s whim can tax them away. The commons will hear of whoever speaks for this, and of whoever does not.","hash":"h1-83e37522"},
    "65cc9b69": {"text":"Consider for household service…","hash":"h1-439e59ff"},
    "65d03521": {"text":"Battle record: {record} · current: {streak}","hash":"h1-120e5650"},
    "65d6058d": {"text":"Make yourself useful.","hash":"h1-564f4714"},
    "65db8805": {"text":"Gniezno","hash":"h1-5c4d4163"},
    "65dbfe4d": {"text":"Renew the right already held by your house.","hash":"h1-b72cb67c"},
    "65e71cfb": {"text":"Patronized the people of a former calling.","hash":"h1-5ecb9b32"},
    "65e8aa75": {"text":"fullsheet-modal guide-modal","hash":"h1-00ce9e37"},
    "65fc3697": {"text":"Spurned her sweetheart and marched home her own woman.","hash":"h1-9afe62d2"},
    "6605879d": {"text":"Harsh discipline raises abstract condition at a cost in reputation.","hash":"h1-cc59ccb0"},
    "660ce5df": {"text":"🎓 {tutor}, a learned master, takes charge of your education for a seasonal fee.","hash":"h1-b4d8934c"},
