    "661a4d7f": {"text":"Won freedom in the struggle over the common.","hash":"h1-1639019a"},
    "66204d21": {"text":"{money:2} says youth beats cunning.","hash":"h1-940be117"},
    "66226cc5": {"text":"Rotary Querns","hash":"h1-e5e9e952"},
    "66231071": {"text":"🏳 The war is done — the host disbands to hearth and field.","hash":"h1-68e58820"},
    "662cf441": {"text":"🏰 You hold the substance of {duchy}, but only the crown may style you duke.","hash":"h1-e9a56f98"},
