    "665d2175": {"text":"Crown authority, council support, national research, diplomacy, and the full realm host become strategic resources.","hash":"h1-8f5d012e"},
    "665dd101": {"text":"Your spear takes the boar before the lord’s. Bold — perhaps too bold. But men saw it.","hash":"h1-27eae6ad"},
    "667dd459": {"text":"Magnates","hash":"h1-01bea363"},
    "668bc65d": {"text":"Gates like cliffs, streets like rivers. In {settlement} a fortune is made or lost every day, and nobody asks where you were born — only what you carry.","hash":"h1-4c55bb2b"},
    "669405a9": {"text":"Blame the marshal.","hash":"h1-968f19fd"},
    "6696168d": {"text":"Ruins of {building}","hash":"h1-e6efa27f"},
    "66a176cf": {"text":"{relation} · Standing {standing}","hash":"h1-182e05e4"},
    "66ae9ba9": {"text":"A new face is news in a place like this. Before the first week is out, a neighbor is at the door with a loaf of bread and a lifetime of advice: the days flow on their own once you let them; a daily focus bends them toward your purpose; a deed is done once and done with; and when the world brings you a choice, time itself will wait for your answer.","hash":"h1-3ddeb232"},
    "66be42c1": {"text":"Leave this slot empty","hash":"h1-f911dca9"},
    "66c208a7": {"text":"No valid local grantor can hear this petition.","hash":"h1-e86f62b6"},
    "66d197c1": {"text":"Choose occupations, arrange apprenticeships, staff shops, and grow family businesses.","hash":"h1-476396a7"},
    "66d334ed": {"text":"Your house already has an active royal marriage compact.","hash":"h1-156114eb"},
    "66d4cbed": {"text":"Family provisions and quarters","hash":"h1-f4bb18d3"},
    "66d7d5b3": {"text":"Bought off a rising against the house.","hash":"h1-9d554898"},
