    "6959fa8b": {"text":"Admit the objective must wait.","hash":"h1-2c76019a"},
    "695f08a1": {"text":"Baltic-Finnic","hash":"h1-9f283222"},
    "696477e3": {"text":"The world shrinks to the man in front of you — and then he is down, and their wall breaks and runs, and you are alive, shaking, splashed to the elbow, and alive. The field and its dead lie open for the looting.","hash":"h1-6e64f7c2"},
    "6965aea5": {"text":"Barghawata","hash":"h1-735a6cb3"},
    "696750df": {"text":"The lands return to the lord who gave them; the family keeps its coffers and its name.","hash":"h1-cbe02260"},
    "6967dd41": {"text":"Merchants and guild masters crowd the lower end of the hall while {liege}’s officers argue over tolls. A fixed charter would make trade predictable; a failed settlement would leave every bridge and market claiming a different due.","hash":"h1-45beb791"},
    "696e86e9": {"text":"👑 The attacking camp wins the {campaign}. A settlement council convenes over the occupied lands.","hash":"h1-a47ca214"},
    "6995efe1": {"text":"Quarrels are put aside. One by one, the households agree to speak with a single voice.","hash":"h1-670f9539"},
    "699772a1": {"text":"Muster Burden","hash":"h1-20fb7119"},
    "69a487e5": {"text":"Commerce, transport, and infrastructure","hash":"h1-f01b39b3"},
    "69a8f68d": {"text":"Call every household together.","hash":"h1-ed7f907b"},
    "69ad04ef": {"text":"Appoint up to two Cardinals while the College is below twelve.","hash":"h1-74ea3d1c"},
    "69af6239": {"text":"Back to life.","hash":"h1-01e401b7"},
    "69b0de61": {"text":"{item} moves from {source} to {name} ({slots}).","hash":"h1-ad8e9f3b"},
    "69bc1da1": {"text":"The game autosaves each spring. Manual slots live in the menu, beside 📤 Export / 📥 Import — a life kept as text survives browsers that wipe their storage, and travels to other devices.","hash":"h1-263bd515"},
    "69c21fe5": {"text":"Technology cap","hash":"h1-1b57cd0f"},
    "69c4548d": {"text":"The ditch asks no coin.","hash":"h1-e2c80a52"},
    "69d3682d": {"text":"The dead are honored, and the living speak of it.","hash":"h1-6eb64a80"},
    "69d79cb1": {"text":"A screw press applies steady force to grapes and fruit.","hash":"h1-94e1e9fe"},
