    "75a4b8a5": {"text":"Practice your calling and earn a place in the day’s work.","hash":"h1-47798ab3"},
    "75b106b5": {"text":"The body pays what the purse is spared.","hash":"h1-a3d674d8"},
    "75b5a83d": {"text":"👶 Your son {parent} has a son, {baby}.","hash":"h1-8a75236e"},
    "75be3021": {"text":"Half-ready is not ready. The whole scheme collapses on your head in daylight.","hash":"h1-54ee2110"},
    "75c2ca55": {"text":"Houses in Competition","hash":"h1-64c3c778"},
    "75c40d49": {"text":"The liege’s jaw tightens at the name. “That fief was wasted on him.” The patent is drawn — {cname} is yours, and the court sees exactly whose star is rising.","hash":"h1-9160aa25"},
    "75c845b1": {"text":"Suitor","hash":"h1-febffa6d"},
    "75cbebe1": {"text":"A burning fever","hash":"h1-dee749a1"},
    "75cfd9eb": {"text":"Let them march home.","hash":"h1-d97637d8"},
