    "75ecb537": {"text":"Costly honesty carries across the sea; their factors answer with a market compact.","hash":"h1-129e796c"},
    "75f17041": {"text":"Scythes hiss in the fields from first light to last. The whole village works, prays, and counts.","hash":"h1-aa3a5671"},
    "76000811": {"text":"Think better of it","hash":"h1-101d6a1d"},
    "760af2c1": {"text":"Spend {piety} piety to claim the vacant office of {title}. The office attaches to your existing realm; no county changes hands and your {prestige} prestige is not spent. Your demesne must hold at least {counties} counties.","hash":"h1-56202819"},
    "76105607": {"text":"Great holy war","hash":"h1-9f79d7fe"},
    "7613ffa1": {"text":"Every thread is in place and {rival} suspects nothing. One word from you and the web draws tight.","hash":"h1-1ce57a66"},
    "7617e329": {"text":"Govern institutions, manage great vassals, defend the crown, and secure succession.","hash":"h1-de2ce0ed"},
    "76195d3d": {"text":"The Caravan","hash":"h1-41b69b26"},
    "761aba99": {"text":"Charcoal-fired bloomeries produce workable iron from local ores.","hash":"h1-92fec7db"},
    "762212c1": {"text":"Rise and consent at once.","hash":"h1-e47dbcc9"},
    "7622ffdd": {"text":"Gentle blood, empty purse. A horse, a blade, and admittance to halls where futures are granted.","hash":"h1-478b6303"},
