    "7c6c1637": {"text":"🏠 The household gives up {level} in {standard}.","hash":"h1-f08dc737"},
    "7c6cd641": {"text":"The captain reads the night-watch roll, pauses at your name, and looks up. Around you, strangers now know whom he means.","hash":"h1-d0fcd0a5"},
    "7c70ad11": {"text":"The markets of {destination} are ready. Your stake can be turned quickly and safely, or risked on the bargain you came all this way to make.","hash":"h1-ad9a894d"},
    "7c70ba6d": {"text":"Northern Wastes","hash":"h1-eae68842"},
    "7c710865": {"text":"💍 The match assistant recommends {match} for {child}. Review the match in Household Plan.","hash":"h1-012d3208"},
    "7c72a813": {"text":"An empty belly, but a clean one.","hash":"h1-9374deda"},
    "7c72e291": {"text":"adoption predates first attestation.","hash":"h1-f2e58321"},
    "7c84bb65": {"text":"Current","hash":"h1-7eb52612"},
    "7c886c01": {"text":"their lands","hash":"h1-f75f5709"},
    "7c90ccf7": {"text":"The cap limits a new arrangement only. It does not reserve money or cancel an existing arrangement if its fee later rises.","hash":"h1-82fc256e"},
    "7c980dc1": {"text":"This school does not teach the chosen focus.","hash":"h1-4eb794f7"},
    "7c9c4b3b": {"text":"A toll is a toll, you are told, whether or not the wheel turned.","hash":"h1-29d4ee90"},
    "7ca46d79": {"text":"Spear practice on the green. (+martial over time)","hash":"h1-bbdea267"},
    "7ca560bb": {"text":"Reputation becomes responsibility.","hash":"h1-6d586a90"},
    "7cab4a19": {"text":"All political attention is assigned. Set another court to Neutral before choosing a new direction here.","hash":"h1-300f43aa"},
    "7cb2f973": {"text":"⚜ {name} is one county alone — no duke’s title to claim.","hash":"h1-6416bff1"},
    "7cb54659": {"text":"Property is bought once and passes to heirs; eligible holdings may be sold or pledged. Maintained transport and work outfits above are expenses, not property.","hash":"h1-10d3521d"},
    "7cb5ec51": {"text":"There is a young man of the next holding — quick to laugh, quicker to blush — and you had half a mind to make him yours. But the war has swallowed the season: the lord’s serjeants are taking every unwed man who can hold a spear, and this morning he stands in the muster line with a borrowed shield on his arm and no notion that you exist. By dusk the company will be a smudge of dust on the war road, and him with it. A woman does not follow an army. Everyone knows that.","hash":"h1-350aa0f8"},
    "7cb9e771": {"text":"Petition at the great houses.","hash":"h1-e69fb1eb"},
    "7ccb3bd9": {"text":"120 volunteers join as levy without a recruitment fee. Their supplies still add about {money:0.6} to seasonal logistics.","hash":"h1-76e21f85"},
    "7cd2eefd": {"text":"Ruler gift","hash":"h1-df1a64bf"},
    "7cd4d36d": {"text":"🎓 You grow {trait}, like your tutor.","hash":"h1-4be72564"},
    "7ce1af41": {"text":"FBS1.","hash":"h1-9730a011"},
    "7ce67201": {"text":"A king who feeds sycophants breeds them.","hash":"h1-0d205d39"},
    "7cf5468d": {"text":"{owner} (~{men})","hash":"h1-174c124c"},
    "7cf58f8d": {"text":"Lawful salvage belongs to the authority that keeps the coast.","hash":"h1-1c9bc6d6"},
    "7cf7ea19": {"text":"Ipswich","hash":"h1-b966cd0a"},
    "7cf99141": {"text":"{cost} research · about {seasons} seasons","hash":"h1-cdfa1380"},
    "7cfd0383": {"text":"Day by day","hash":"h1-a56fed1c"},
    "7cfd63f9": {"text":"The work comes together beneath hands the master trained.","hash":"h1-ca08bc1d"},
    "7d03b103": {"text":"PgDn","hash":"h1-ffe064d2"},
    "7d0de331": {"text":"You catch him older and slower than his stories. The garrison hoots; he pays with a grin.","hash":"h1-144befad"},
    "7d25fa49": {"text":"The clergy ask the estates to protect sanctuary and relief in {province}; the liege’s officers answer that every exemption leaves another household to serve. The hall must decide whether legitimacy is bought with spears, silver, or mercy.","hash":"h1-2247a371"},
    "7d28dbf1": {"text":"blood feud","hash":"h1-5f761611"},
    "7d298dd1": {"text":"The great offices have not formed yet; the next simulation boundary will establish them.","hash":"h1-9bbe6abf"},
    "7d3012bd": {"text":"Plowman’s daughter","hash":"h1-4701f55b"},
    "7d35cdb3": {"text":"Intrigue, learning, and renown must carry a document older-looking than it is.","hash":"h1-4a22505e"},
    "7d3bf1d9": {"text":"Pannonia","hash":"h1-5c75369d"},
    "7d3d1469": {"text":"🕯 Your mother {name} has died, aged {age}.","hash":"h1-0ce985fc"},
    "7d42d27f": {"text":"{count} semantic bindings saved. Number keys remain positional in dialogs.","hash":"h1-3f41c0a9"},
    "7d479179": {"text":"🕯 {name}’s tutor has died; the lessons pause.","hash":"h1-84e5681c"},
    "7d47f813": {"text":"🏅 {name}’s guild family sponsors you at the masters’ bench.","hash":"h1-02b8e041"},
    "7d482913": {"text":"No living candidate.","hash":"h1-0beee848"},
    "7d4bc301": {"text":"Keep in service","hash":"h1-a30ba2a4"},
    "7d4bde7d": {"text":"His guards were better than his prices. Men are hurt for nothing.","hash":"h1-9f2f4978"},
    "7d4de7e5": {"text":"A new heir can say what the dead could not.","hash":"h1-e15750bc"},
    "7d527981": {"text":"Next at development {threshold}: {change}.","hash":"h1-ad9e5cbc"},
    "7d662fe5": {"text":"Bled fierce and long before it closed.","hash":"h1-e7e7b6df"},
    "7d66df09": {"text":"A bloody nose now, or a toll forever.","hash":"h1-1e1caa0c"},
    "7d72fe93": {"text":"Coin is coin, whatever the motive.","hash":"h1-745cfaa0"},
    "7d864c81": {"text":"Coin and patience buy a durable improvement in Standing.","hash":"h1-608863b9"},
    "7d8a870d": {"text":"Costs {money:gold} and {piety} piety; the church decides after you spend the day.","hash":"h1-90d22fc7"},
    "7d9a5969": {"text":"Bargain for recognition","hash":"h1-6e127c0d"},
    "7d9feb89": {"text":"In the recess, a hoarse old lord corners you by the wine: his grandson’s inheritance was shaved by {liege}’s courts, and he means to stand up in the hall and say so. He wants voices beside his — yours, loudly. The liege’s clerks are watching who nods.","hash":"h1-c0ee59af"},
    "7da1af49": {"text":"The insult falls flat. {name} answers better, and the laughter is theirs.","hash":"h1-8aad326c"},
    "7dade7ed": {"text":"Claim the glory — if the guild allows ambition.","hash":"h1-18bf8a3f"},
    "7dbcb291": {"forms":{"select":"value","param":"temper","cases":{"bellicose":"✉ Stolen letters expose {realm}’s court as dangerously bellicose; no war order is presently sealed.","cautious":"✉ Stolen letters expose {realm}’s court as cautious; no war order is presently sealed.","other":"✉ Stolen letters expose {realm}’s court as watchful; no war order is presently sealed."}},"hash":"h1-567a651c"},
    "7dbd3589": {"text":"{season} {day} · {year} AD","hash":"h1-ab0be1cd"},
    "7dc11c39": {"text":"Each improvement replaces the previous level’s upkeep. Open a row for its full ownership, effect, succession, and lapse details.","hash":"h1-4a385ddf"},
    "7dce849f": {"text":"🚩 There is no road from here to the enemy host.","hash":"h1-b5c22338"},
