    "7df2f701": {"text":"Oaths, it turns out, can be eaten.","hash":"h1-5dde1ed1"},
    "7e0042c1": {"text":"Masonry keeps and curtains turn elite residences into durable fortresses.","hash":"h1-4d1cebec"},
    "7e097453": {"text":"Choose a purpose and travel county by county over game time.","hash":"h1-b1913d1e"},
    "7e0dec89": {"text":"the first settlement becomes a city","hash":"h1-0aa68a27"},
    "7e19dcad": {"text":"The crowd’s roar turns to a gasp as you go over the crupper, helm ringing. They carry you from the lists with honor — and with a headache for the ages.","hash":"h1-b27a0226"},
    "7e275e31": {"text":"age {age} · ⚔ martial {martial}","hash":"h1-66e4ea2b"},
    "7e290e19": {"text":"Raised and drained roadbeds keep important routes usable in wet seasons.","hash":"h1-01952d1d"},
    "7e2a114d": {"text":"Your scheming is uncovered and named for what it is.","hash":"h1-4052a8d7"},
