    "7f1d8fa9": {"text":"Profited from the closing of the common.","hash":"h1-91f496cd"},
    "7f26c3cd": {"text":"You stand a round with your last coppers and bawl the filthy marching songs louder than any. They call you a good lad and mean it — and a good lad is never questioned.","hash":"h1-7ffa0a87"},
