    "841e4d71": {"text":"💰 The crown debases the coinage and takes {money:gold} in seigniorage. Prices and confidence suffer.","hash":"h1-706398eb"},
    "842c37f9": {"text":"You have chosen your moment and rehearsed your words; today you mean to ask {suitor} for a life together. But the war reaches your door first. Even as you square your shoulders to speak, the lord’s serjeants are working down the lane — and {suitor}’s name is among those called, every unwed man who can hold a spear. There will be no answer today: only a borrowed shield thrust into his arms, and dust on the war road by dusk.","hash":"h1-19f405a9"},
    "84323f97": {"text":"⬇ Landless once more. The banners are folded away.","hash":"h1-9bdd5c62"},
    "84335623": {"text":"Your own soil, your own sweat.","hash":"h1-991cd458"},
    "8436c401": {"text":"{title} · {realm}","hash":"h1-6d5f58c4"},
    "8438bb3d": {"text":"Keep every county for now and let the refusal settle into local resentment.","hash":"h1-858a0310"},
