    "843a4a41": {"text":"Duchy of","hash":"h1-ddc2ff69"},
    "843b950f": {"text":"Word rides ahead of the heralds: {lord} proclaims a tourney for the dry roads — bright harness, blunted lances, a melee for the young swords, and a champion’s purse. Every ambitious blade in the province means to be there. Will you ride in the lists?","hash":"h1-9bb0b33b"},
