    "85d397f5": {"text":"stand on the prize and press the siege at three war councils. Allies send abstract defenders only when you are attacked; they never become separate war participants. Field victories make the enemy sue for peace. Attacked yourself? Keep their host out of your lands — three seasons unchecked and a province falls. Past eight seasons, exhaustion ends the war with nothing gained.","hash":"h1-8e8c837b"},
