    "88623e05": {"text":"Take the landless knights into service. ({money:20})","hash":"h1-6ce3e47f"},
    "88634f93": {"text":"Keeps accounts, directs servants, and makes the household’s work run more cleanly.","hash":"h1-c669b924"},
