    "8885afe1": {"text":"Grey heads in the court nod at the old precedents. The writ is withdrawn, with as much grace as a court can manage.","hash":"h1-c50b4d40"},
    "88861cb1": {"text":"Snowmelt has turned the ford brown and violent. A cart has slewed sideways in the current, with a family clinging to it as the water rises.","hash":"h1-6095236b"},
    "8886f901": {"text":"Demand a duel.","hash":"h1-fa73c571"},
    "88873541": {"text":"The sermon will keep; your attention does not.","hash":"h1-0dffefb9"},
