    "88d12189": {"text":"Counted everything. The graveyard steward sends regards.","hash":"h1-f4511be5"},
    "88d1533f": {"text":"A sour fever moves from tent to tent. Men who marched yesterday cannot stand today, and tonight your own skin feels too hot.","hash":"h1-8b91e4da"},
    "88d73f91": {"text":"The lord tires of the question. The toll stands.","hash":"h1-a112b685"},
