    "8940bb17": {"text":"Only a sovereign may offer a foreign peace pact.","hash":"h1-3542cec8"},
    "89417ca9": {"text":"Late study breeds late thoughts. In the margin of an old text you have written something that, read coldly, smells of heresy. Another hand has underlined it.","hash":"h1-e4009a37"},
    "8947272b": {"text":"The old custom names a widow’s third. Their clerks will argue.","hash":"h1-a2e00d70"},
    "894c2935": {"text":"Undermine your rival by fair means or foul.","hash":"h1-4813596b"},
    "89583977": {"text":"{have} of {total} county","hash":"h1-ca797ede"},
    "895f5b31": {"text":"Independent ruler","hash":"h1-43208b35"},
    "8960f811": {"text":"Rode to the liege’s war.","hash":"h1-c6557215"},
    "89634e51": {"text":"Send the host home where it stands. On your realm’s land only {pct}% return to the rolls — {men} preserved; the next muster must wait {days} days.","hash":"h1-5f8a3ae5"},
    "89682cf1": {"text":"How the great ones argue, flatter, and threaten — a free education.","hash":"h1-5335cb65"},
    "896e89e5": {"text":"Arrange an apprenticeship, change occupation, or seek guild rank.","hash":"h1-413c9dea"},
