    "8a786139": {"text":"Keep clean hands and leave the failed petition behind.","hash":"h1-f554dbd5"},
    "8a820cc1": {"text":"Pride keeps poor company at night.","hash":"h1-f12ddcf9"},
    "8a93150f": {"text":"Sails on the Horizon","hash":"h1-28b848ba"},
    "8a93abc1": {"text":"The reeve arrives with a new tally, and your name sits at the top of it — extra boon-days, and a “customary” gift no one else is asked to pay. {lord}’s dislike has found its way into the ledger.","hash":"h1-e82c12a8"},
