    "8b847859": {"text":"The poisoner walks into it, and under questioning gives up a name. The knives stop — and {rival} knows that you know.","hash":"h1-040cc781"},
    "8b8df4c5": {"text":"Somewhere, ink remembers what men deny.","hash":"h1-308df39a"},
    "8b9716b5": {"text":"Simple majority","hash":"h1-efb5801a"},
    "8ba0c83d": {"text":"The hall is full and the mood is sour before the first word: {liege}’s steward reads the demand twice over — a greater aid from every vassal, a heavier cut of every rent and toll, “for the good of the realm.” The benches turn to look at the men who will answer first. One of them is you.","hash":"h1-163997f0"},
    "8ba1a1d3": {"text":"Retainer contracts each season","hash":"h1-df011866"},
    "8ba40e95": {"text":"Turn victory into a step up the ladder.","hash":"h1-31f24adf"},
