    "8cad7bd1": {"text":"Open your house to new life once more.","hash":"h1-941f3f3d"},
    "8cae7fcd": {"text":"A lance like a siege-beam lifts you clean from the saddle. You wake staring at the clouds, ribs singing, while the stands cheer the other man.","hash":"h1-3aa54ed7"},
