    "8cfc8c97": {"text":"The assassin hangs in your dungeon. Under hard questioning, a name is finally spat out — a rival hand paid for your death.","hash":"h1-8edcf958"},
    "8cfe3731": {"text":"There is little to do now but bar the door and pray.","hash":"h1-865f04b1"},
