    "8d534739": {"text":"A right unenforced soon ceases to be a right.","hash":"h1-471ee5dd"},
    "8d615101": {"text":"Pay for redress, end the grudge, and bind the judgment by charter.","hash":"h1-131a1051"},
    "8d6f878d": {"text":"Spurn him grandly. You have outgrown the blushing boy from the muster line.","hash":"h1-5dc04d44"},
    "8d81b9d9": {"text":"The first rope parts and whips your hands raw.","hash":"h1-800a31f5"},
    "8da14051": {"text":"You have chosen your moment and rehearsed your words; today you mean to ask {suitor} for a life together. But the war reaches your door first. Even as you square your shoulders to speak, the amir’s men are working down the lane — and {suitor}’s name is among those called, every unwed youth who can level a spear. There will be no answer today: only a borrowed shield thrust into his arms, and dust on the war-road by dusk.","hash":"h1-766745cd"},
    "8da34c59": {"text":"Raises craft output by 10%.","hash":"h1-bafdeb2e"},
