    "930dabd9": {"text":"Envoys bring it back from every court you once outshone: in their chanceries your scribes are corrected, in their halls your heralds are made to wait. The letters still style you as of old — but fewer mouths do, and the land no longer answers for it. A great style without its substance is only noise.","hash":"h1-df942217"},
