    "a0ebbcff": {"text":"Your oldest armsman is found in the millrace, drowned in a foot of water — and he could swim. Someone inside your walls is paid. The household eats in silence and watches itself; the net is closing, and you cannot see its ropes.","hash":"h1-e401bb26"},
