    "b1f40573": {"text":"📖 The chronicle of {dynasty} begins in {province}, {year} AD.","hash":"h1-aa582077"},
    "b201d1bf": {"text":"The charter spends the day and cannot be renewed, revoked, or replaced before it ends. It ends early only if the dynasty loses landed authority.","hash":"h1-27bc6cd2"},
    "b2049ec9": {"text":"Name the fear, then master it.","hash":"h1-90efa885"},
    "b205eba1": {"text":"🕯 Your granddaughter {name} has died, aged {age}.","hash":"h1-090551df"},
    "b210505f": {"text":"Living sons then daughters are eligible first. With no living child, the order continues through same-house grandchildren, siblings, nieces and nephews, uncles and aunts, then cousins.","hash":"h1-e99ebc5a"},
    "b2197aa1": {"text":"Fell in battle at {province} against {enemy}.","hash":"h1-4ae71325"},
    "b2248ff1": {"text":"Letters Under a Broken Seal","hash":"h1-5f119bdd"},
    "b22c0f91": {"text":"Crush them with steel.","hash":"h1-8e50c6b1"},
    "b2357411": {"text":"Durable iron sickles shorten the dangerous work of harvest.","hash":"h1-68c9dc3d"},
    "b23b2eff": {"text":"Buy witnesses, copy charters, and give a neighboring county a lawful-looking past.","hash":"h1-34cf73ce"},
    "b23e0821": {"text":"🏛 The Royal Council…","hash":"h1-a94f1173"},
    "b255baad": {"text":"Both merchant benches accept the equal charter.","hash":"h1-0befe38a"},
    "b26f7971": {"text":"The river keeps its secrets; so will you.","hash":"h1-5f04bf61"},
    "b2763a01": {"text":"No monopoly terms are defined for this grantor’s tier.","hash":"h1-bfb69d31"},
    "b27c49f5": {"text":"the enemy","hash":"h1-44310ea4"},
    "b2816931": {"text":"Let records settle what pride cannot.","hash":"h1-31d487d2"},
    "b2889d93": {"text":"Foggia","hash":"h1-47a492c2"},
    "b28ced09": {"text":"🤝 Your crown and {realm} enter a defensive alliance.","hash":"h1-d6af2d1c"},
    "b2930275": {"text":"Hired mercenaries for the war.","hash":"h1-fcecdf1f"},
    "b2990219": {"text":"A permanent home can be considered after {days} more days here.","hash":"h1-0d103160"},
    "b2994911": {"text":"Maintained husbandry equipment that improves paid farming and family enterprises, but is not saleable property.","hash":"h1-0d2bbff2"},
    "b29a0a4d": {"text":"Deliberate feeding, culling, and breeding make herds more dependable.","hash":"h1-c85826d6"},
    "b2a128cd": {"text":"+{amount}% education success chance","hash":"h1-eea85d4c"},
    "b2a1df45": {"text":"Cow them before they march.","hash":"h1-85943390"},
    "b2af316d": {"text":"🕯 Your niece {name} has died, aged {age}.","hash":"h1-1045d841"},
    "b2bde845": {"text":"none chosen","hash":"h1-6a4e95e3"},
    "b2c75b71": {"text":"🌱 Courtship and marriage live in the Deeds tab, under Life & Family — a spouse is the first deed of a dynasty.","hash":"h1-6d2ad575"},
    "b2cc8f99": {"forms":{"select":"value","param":"subject","cases":{"self":"🎓 You return to instruction at home.","other":"🎓 {name} returns to instruction at home."}},"hash":"h1-06648d44"},
    "b2da3231": {"text":"Qatif","hash":"h1-306a8286"},
    "b2e7d7fd": {"text":"Weights, ledgers, roads, and the trust that lets silver travel.","hash":"h1-e994216b"},
    "b2ee60d1": {"text":"Not recognized by you","hash":"h1-8a1f2f44"},
    "b2eff493": {"text":"Your trap catches a scullion — innocent, probably. The real agent reports your defenses in detail.","hash":"h1-c30b1e10"},
    "b2ffb737": {"text":"A quarrel between two companies ends with a knife in the mud and both sides reaching for spears. The whole camp waits on the judgment.","hash":"h1-f41faeb2"},
    "b2ffc411": {"text":"👑 Invested, you answer now to {realm}.","hash":"h1-8672bd1b"},
    "b30cc1fd": {"text":"Rig a rope and lever from the bank.","hash":"h1-7f33e2aa"},
    "b312e227": {"text":"Sickness has taken hold.","hash":"h1-eac4c632"},
    "b319c299": {"text":"The great mortality walks, and it stopped here.","hash":"h1-3ceedc95"},
    "b31a4deb": {"text":"A neighbor’s fief hangs on the liege’s mood.","hash":"h1-60fdea68"},
    "b329c699": {"text":"🕯 {name}, betrothed to your son {child}, has died before the wedding.","hash":"h1-511da310"},
    "b32a0bbd": {"text":"+{standing} Standing. This exact object leaves family ownership. (spends the day)","hash":"h1-c2e57a0a"},
    "b32c1ac1": {"text":"🧭 The relationship visit ends; you turn toward home.","hash":"h1-e56474b1"},
    "b3323781": {"text":"Dung is gathered and spread where its fertility is most useful.","hash":"h1-5a45cb91"},
    "b334260d": {"text":"Await the answer.","hash":"h1-b984e742"},
    "b33c123b": {"text":"Direct tax & levy multiplier","hash":"h1-3ee09c0e"},
    "b33fbc11": {"text":"Eligible unseated vassal","hash":"h1-2e21551f"},
    "b3504def": {"text":"Lead your sworn swords into the press — glory shared is glory still.","hash":"h1-f2a018e6"},
    "b364a519": {"text":"Public worship, teaching, judgment, and the care of souls.","hash":"h1-71b63fdb"},
    "b37001a1": {"text":"You stand at the summit of the world.","hash":"h1-966ac699"},
    "b376c591": {"text":"A double-edged sword made for the close press of a shield wall.","hash":"h1-044a62a1"},
    "b3888de9": {"text":"Uses one political-attention assignment until set to Neutral.","hash":"h1-f53c5ede"},
