    "b395f493": {"text":"your current life. Copy it somewhere safe — a note, an email to yourself — then paste it back with 📥 Import on any device or browser. It is long; that is normal.","hash":"h1-10c78250"},
    "b39d350d": {"text":"🎒 Yours now: {item}.","hash":"h1-23b4b1bf"},
    "b39f96d9": {"text":"Public patience and abstract supply recover; live troops remain.","hash":"h1-ac00ef0d"},
    "b3a7dd71": {"text":"Counties over the limit: {count}. The multiplier applies to your own demesne tax and levy, not vassal contributions.","hash":"h1-2d1bc532"},
    "b3b065a1": {"text":"{kind} · a day’s outing","hash":"h1-47bb89cf"},
    "b3b589a9": {"text":"It is not about strength. You pay up, aching in new places — and wiser.","hash":"h1-1a486d15"},
    "b3c3387f": {"text":"Fresh stakes stand across the waste where the households of {province} have grazed beasts, cut fuel, and drawn water since anyone remembers. The reeve says it is the lord’s land, and tomorrow it will be closed.","hash":"h1-5305a5aa"},
    "b3c88055": {"text":"Scribe","hash":"h1-16ab9c0f"},
    "b3cc3141": {"text":"The Young Hawk","hash":"h1-d45b19a9"},
    "b3cc9999": {"text":"{key} is assigned more than once.","hash":"h1-4f224dd6"},
    "b3d87e67": {"text":"Strike half-ready, and pray speed makes up for it.","hash":"h1-6139363c"},
    "b3da1aad": {"text":"Old grudges prove stronger than old custom. Half the village will not stand beside the other half.","hash":"h1-9b1a3c13"},
    "b3db6171": {"text":"Stay. This is home, chains and all.","hash":"h1-fc494c81"},
    "b3dd67b1": {"text":"Personally at war with {realm}.","hash":"h1-e4b6896f"},
    "b3e74587": {"text":"{icon} {name} — Raise Next","hash":"h1-3e1d9f40"},
    "b3ea90b9": {"text":"Great men’s secrets, if the steward looks away.","hash":"h1-f8a6b6a3"},
    "b3fac8b5": {"text":"Take the wage in coin.","hash":"h1-37f96393"},
    "b4093c3d": {"text":"Uppsala","hash":"h1-127f36d3"},
    "b40b4a67": {"text":"Better a free fall than a kneeling survival.","hash":"h1-d3a10c54"},
    "b4224e7b": {"text":"Gold-spend cap: {money:amount}","hash":"h1-fd9e13d8"},
    "b4356671": {"text":"Pay a stranger to march in your place.","hash":"h1-3e059d67"},
    "b4370425": {"text":"There is a young man of the next steading — quick to laugh, quicker to blush — and you had half a mind to make him yours. But the war has swallowed the season: the chief’s men are taking every unwed lad who can hold a spear, and this morning he stands in the muster with a borrowed shield on his arm and no notion that you exist. By dusk the war-band will be a smudge of dust on the road, and him with it. They will say a woman has no place in the shield-ring. The old songs, which you know by heart, say otherwise.","hash":"h1-ec32aecc"},
    "b43c07f5": {"text":"⚔ Rome changes hands; the victorious claimant becomes the Roman Pope, but the schism endures.","hash":"h1-caed0bfe"},
    "b43c1e6d": {"text":"Saving","hash":"h1-94b1bec7"},
    "b4419151": {"text":"cavalry","hash":"h1-d66e13f1"},
    "b4518019": {"text":"Mounted Relay Posts","hash":"h1-f950cbd5"},
