    "b460245d": {"text":"Viterbo","hash":"h1-723fe5c4"},
    "b4701031": {"text":"Braunschweig","hash":"h1-e5cf3407"},
    "b4715afb": {"text":"Unknown enterprise","hash":"h1-676fe5a4"},
    "b4816791": {"text":"Three courses, three splintered lances, and the herald cries your name. {lord} hangs the champion’s purse on your lance-tip with his own hands.","hash":"h1-37c86966"},
    "b490658f": {"text":"If carried, your home county gains a chartered market: richer tolls and cheaper building, for a small seasonal upkeep.","hash":"h1-cb279ce6"},
    "b49103e1": {"text":"🛡 Drill with the levy","hash":"h1-89cb0ff5"},
    "b4a39339": {"text":"Path: establish your gentle house. An heir who inherits its standing may petition for a barony; battlefield and church elevations remain exceptional roads.","hash":"h1-b9400d68"},
    "b4a6a141": {"text":": invalid technology seed","hash":"h1-03d310e9"},
