    "b8763ef9": {"text":"Two neighboring houses have fallen out over a mill-race, and both send riders to your hall the same afternoon, seeking your name for their cause.","hash":"h1-7e779edc"},
    "b8775079": {"text":"Direct levy base","hash":"h1-456f1147"},
    "b88d2b1d": {"text":"Illuminator’s Desk and Pigments","hash":"h1-e3ffe128"},
    "b88e2165": {"text":"War. The reeve reads the summons at the {temple} door: every able man of {province} to muster with spear, shield, and three weeks’ bread.","hash":"h1-07ed1ba3"},
    "b8ab3fa5": {"text":"The displayed value is current even when one of these systems is unavailable to this character. Individual events may use the skill in additional checks.","hash":"h1-f166ed24"},
    "b8b0947f": {"text":"Send your regrets.","hash":"h1-99fc85da"},
    "b8b6ac4f": {"text":"The knife finds you as you scramble.","hash":"h1-666f343e"},
    "b8d230f5": {"text":"Road","hash":"h1-abdd92f7"},
    "b8d973c9": {"text":"One of your sworn men arrives with too many retainers and too few courtesies, demanding lower dues and a seat at your right hand.","hash":"h1-fb2be12c"},
    "b8daba39": {"text":"Full figure of {name}","hash":"h1-f9d08917"},
    "b8dc2911": {"text":"{name} resides in {destination}. The route is {legs} county legs and {days} travel days each way.","hash":"h1-d077b484"},
    "b8e3b935": {"text":"A lord forgives many things — absence is not one.","hash":"h1-7dab8270"},
    "b8fa9f31": {"text":"Good material becomes expensive scrap. The widow says nothing.","hash":"h1-b0668c97"},
    "b8fabaa1": {"text":"The Viking Age","hash":"h1-12597475"},
    "b9075c5b": {"text":"Offer patronage to a sovereign that recognizes a rival claimant.","hash":"h1-d8ead838"},
    "b9088fed": {"text":"⛓ {province} signs the ransom roll — you ride home a county poorer, and free.","hash":"h1-444f33ef"},
    "b918aea5": {"text":"The frost comes early and stays like an unwanted guest. Firewood dwindles; the old and the weak begin to die.","hash":"h1-ace723db"},
    "b91a6389": {"text":": missing prerequisite","hash":"h1-e6df3df5"},
    "b91d1c29": {"text":"An invitation to ride with {lord}’s hunt — hounds, horns, and the talk between great men that shapes small futures.","hash":"h1-778cad85"},
