    "baace9f1": {"text":"Assistant off · descendant matches remain manual","hash":"h1-284495d1"},
    "bab609a3": {"text":"It is the finest thing you have ever made. Word spreads.","hash":"h1-2aa36888"},
    "babec8bd": {"text":"A Road Out of the War","hash":"h1-0b807fe2"},
    "baccf681": {"text":"Only a living head of the house can retire.","hash":"h1-a03c887c"},
    "bacdc55d": {"text":"One of your councillors — all smiles and low bows — waylays you after the sitting with a small gift and large praise: your wisdom, your justice, your very profile on the coinage. He wants something, of course. They always do.","hash":"h1-ebaaa564"},
    "bacf755d": {"text":"🤝 {name}’s guild family opens its purse and its contacts to your household.","hash":"h1-1f942a2a"},
    "bacffb85": {"text":"Stirrup Cavalry","hash":"h1-4310305e"},
    "bad6ccb1": {"text":"Because now it does. Hard drill, and no one looking too closely.","hash":"h1-96b3dedf"},
    "badb0c47": {"text":"Work beside them until the fire is beaten.","hash":"h1-42f813a8"},
    "bae27cb5": {"text":"Firenze","hash":"h1-9c8986b8"},
