    "bb99b6e1": {"text":"Kind words pay no collectors.","hash":"h1-1fe3d7b5"},
    "bb99c8a5": {"text":"Demand a fief back into your own hand. A contented vassal yields; a bitter one answers with spears.","hash":"h1-3a404308"},
    "bb9dbc63": {"text":"The old formula leaves little room to wriggle. The right is older than the reeve’s office.","hash":"h1-93f95148"},
    "bbaa5a87": {"text":"The forester finds you beyond the new stakes and reports the trespass.","hash":"h1-f38d322e"},
    "bbae9e2d": {"text":"Not yet. Save more first.","hash":"h1-bd46e2b4"},
    "bbbb4cc9": {"text":"Bid on the lot. ({money:8})","hash":"h1-4d1cfec8"},
    "bbbd0ee1": {"text":"The savior of the mill argues his wage.","hash":"h1-94bbf479"},
    "bbc164bf": {"text":"Reserved vassals are skipped when vacancies fill automatically and are not recommended first. You may still appoint them manually.","hash":"h1-a26573b2"},
    "bbc26619": {"text":"Raises farming output by 10%.","hash":"h1-b3bcd6e4"},
    "bbc76eb9": {"text":"Costly and weary, but the grain gets ground.","hash":"h1-484e10f3"},
    "bbcac085": {"text":"Nothing more can be raised in your lands.","hash":"h1-94b65ca4"},
    "bbce9cd1": {"text":"Stand your ground and pray he admires it.","hash":"h1-08f836c5"},
    "bbd985b5": {"text":"He calls the repair a tenant’s duty and takes the toll besides.","hash":"h1-e7eea60c"},
    "bbdd03f9": {"text":"Gravity-powered throwing arms hurl heavy stones with repeatable force.","hash":"h1-a3b0d55b"},
