    "bc29cdf7": {"text":"No more land is for sale here.","hash":"h1-653d3b66"},
    "bc2dbb4b": {"text":"A petition asks the reigning Pope for a personal appointment. The office grants station 4 and 3.5 piety each season, but no county or secular promotion.","hash":"h1-f85f4c72"},
    "bc3d69a1": {"text":"{childname} turns sixteen. The years of lessons are over — schooled, drilled, and shaped by your design, a young adult of real promise now stands where the child once fidgeted.","hash":"h1-7d18781a"},
    "bc3e48a1": {"text":"Shouting, shoving, a slammed door — and they withdraw, vowing to return. You have won a season, no more.","hash":"h1-78a62d9b"},
    "bc3f335d": {"text":"Review domain cleanup…","hash":"h1-95cb104b"},
    "bc43625d": {"text":"An old schedule fixes a modest toll and saves both faces.","hash":"h1-caa6651b"},
    "bc468115": {"text":"Novice of the Faith","hash":"h1-a1d36493"},
    "bc50ff79": {"text":"Honor their confidence.","hash":"h1-41bafd1d"},
    "bc56a715": {"text":"{count} member houses","hash":"h1-9d81ead8"},
    "bc7243cf": {"text":"Work upon one elector through trust, friendship, and practical argument.","hash":"h1-5c28a2fc"},
    "bc7f7969": {"text":"🕊 The enemy sues for peace. Your lands are safe.","hash":"h1-5670fbce"},
    "bc813945": {"text":"🏛 Governance","hash":"h1-1f1c915c"},
    "bc8b7385": {"text":"A keen blade close at hand is worth more than the coppers it costs.","hash":"h1-6f7b5663"},
    "bc8d2719": {"text":"Nishapur","hash":"h1-6ea4c215"},
    "bc9d68c7": {"text":"Review vassals and institutions.","hash":"h1-7ffcfe98"},
