    "eccd73f1": {"text":"{rival} dines your neighbors, remembers their sons’ names, and asks — always lightly — whether the land might not be better served. A spy in their household brings worse: parchments are being drawn up.","hash":"h1-b8d8c2d3"},
    "ecd479c5": {"text":"{position} pay — {name}","hash":"h1-0bd11e2b"},
    "ecdbf301": {"text":"Riding with the liege’s host","hash":"h1-f62b2dd9"},
    "ece5ef4d": {"text":"Steward","hash":"h1-bc349a27"},
    "ecebe021": {"text":"Cardinal {name}","hash":"h1-19fe9bef"},
    "ecebfced": {"text":"Let them compete for it.","hash":"h1-9a5e37e7"},
    "ecedc65f": {"text":"Maritime Loans","hash":"h1-a3607c24"},
    "ecf1247f": {"text":"reserved from grants","hash":"h1-6c7447c6"},
    "ecf6b4f1": {"text":"Shield-Wall Tactics","hash":"h1-e8e4012e"},
    "ecfd5775": {"text":"Your motion before the estates: that your home county, thinned by years of musters, be spared the levy for a season of seasons — and that the aid rise in exchange, so {liege}’s chest loses nothing. The lords with villages of their own to strip listen closely.","hash":"h1-32cc79be"},
    "ecfdc025": {"text":"Reject the charter and keep every old claim alive.","hash":"h1-b2e266b3"},
    "ed000861": {"text":"Events and oaths use this exact person.","hash":"h1-51be1c4f"},
    "ed075181": {"text":"Treadle Loom","hash":"h1-e8b4e0b9"},
    "ed0d1445": {"text":"About {money:amount} each season while worked by {name}; shown in Money each season","hash":"h1-59003c95"},
    "ed14f765": {"text":"Bust","hash":"h1-d7f47ac3"},
    "ed199569": {"text":"A seat on the bench, if the town will have you.","hash":"h1-ac8bd85e"},
