    "ed4b2eb1": {"text":"The belly rebels and will not be reasoned with.","hash":"h1-d40d9331"},
    "ed55ab61": {"text":"Show the banners where the land is still yours — the wavering may remember themselves.","hash":"h1-ded130f9"},
    "ed5ba59f": {"text":"Levy Exemption","hash":"h1-2e89638c"},
    "ed5f5c9d": {"text":"Recognition","hash":"h1-18901104"},
    "ed70ff33": {"text":"March on their army in the field — battle joins when you catch it.","hash":"h1-52d3300a"},
    "ed75fde3": {"text":"Republic of Venice","hash":"h1-2b25c2d6"},
    "ed780b6f": {"text":"Drive away everyone without a spear.","hash":"h1-2c1ece70"},
    "ed8fa7a9": {"text":"Travel to cultivate this ruler…","hash":"h1-e2729fb5"},
    "ed952181": {"text":"Two of your great officers have not spoken in a month, and today the quarrel spills onto the council table — an old boundary, an older insult, voices rising. Both look to you. Both will remember who you favored.","hash":"h1-18d54ad1"},
