    "edcd39cb": {"text":"See what he carries.","hash":"h1-c497d414"},
    "edcfc399": {"text":"The fee cap applies separately to each child when an arrangement is selected. It does not reserve household funds; unaffordable seasonal fees still pause lessons and retry later.","hash":"h1-9a4befe3"},
