    "ef033545": {"text":"Eligible: same-house grandchild; no living child is ahead of this branch.","hash":"h1-297f54fa"},
    "ef0bc3c9": {"text":"The first man through finds himself back in the mud. The rest decide another roof is easier.","hash":"h1-684cfeff"},
