    "ef432641": {"text":"It will not stop a lance, but it has turned many a tired sword.","hash":"h1-e8eabd98"},
    "ef4cb68d": {"text":"The mourning is done, and the kin of {late} send a clerk with a strongbox and papers. What was settled on your marriage must now be paid out — though their faces say they would rather not.","hash":"h1-3f903483"},
