    "efb9c8bb": {"text":"Refuse, with thanks.","hash":"h1-947ff274"},
    "efbd6a03": {"text":"Powers apply only while equipped. Skills and health affect the wearer; battle and seasonal resources count only on the head of the family.","hash":"h1-c2c9db66"},
    "efca7cc9": {"text":"more fertile","hash":"h1-f1f33285"},
    "efd02b8b": {"text":"Your riders return laden, leaving mirrored smoke on their horizon.","hash":"h1-84386fb2"},
    "efd9c301": {"text":"Both magnates accept a rule that honors each without yielding to either.","hash":"h1-b74859ef"},
    "efe5b7e1": {"text":"Report the plotters to the liege.","hash":"h1-b32bcc59"},
    "efebe7a3": {"text":"The family refuses — politely, but firmly. Perhaps with more standing, or more silver…","hash":"h1-36f0f438"},
    "eff35e61": {"text":"Organized anatomical descriptions guide teaching and surgical memory.","hash":"h1-897cd2f1"},
    "effd33b9": {"text":"The ink is too fresh. The true evidence is buried beneath the exposed forgery.","hash":"h1-84d3f5bd"},
    "effe2569": {"text":"A mace finds your helm; your men drag you clear. You bled in the liege’s cause, and that too is remembered.","hash":"h1-5776a976"},
    "f006e3b1": {"text":"The great officers of the crown lend their strength to yours — but magnates have tempers, and the council weighs every act of the crown.","hash":"h1-173fba01"},
