    "f029ebc1": {"text":"Choose the exact land named in the vow.","hash":"h1-2ec74e6e"},
    "f02e4a1d": {"text":"The emir requires a chief judge for the whole province, and hints the appointment can be yours — for merit, or for a “gift to the treasury” of {money:200}.","hash":"h1-1f681269"},
