    "f1c5df29": {"text":"💒 Your granddaughter {child} weds {spouse}, as was pledged.","hash":"h1-c3691ebc"},
    "f1d3fc41": {"text":"Compare every available cause before choosing. A recognized right avoids the political penalties of a War of Aggression. Land is taken only by siege: march your host onto the named prize and press the siege at three war councils. Field victories bring the enemy to the table, nothing more.","hash":"h1-3a7d7539"},
